# Entity: Terminaling_Throughputs_Customers_Dim
:mdm_core_Terminaling_Throughputs_Customers_Dim a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Terminaling_Throughputs_Customers_Dim" ;
    dcterms:identifier "5" ;
    dcterms:description """This table captures master profiles and accounting reference mappings for third-party oil companies, traders, and joint-venture partners utilizing leased terminal storage and handling infrastructure. It links customer entities with associated supplier records and physical facility accounting locations to manage fee-based throughput agreements. Downstream, it provides the foundation for tracking third-party inventory movements and accurately invoicing tariff, transit, and handling fees.""" ;
    :externalTermLinkMissing true .

