    dcterms:description """This dimension table serves as the master commercial registry for customers purchasing products across bulk liquid terminals within the Terminal Automation System (TAS). It manages customer identification, physical billing details, credit limits, real-time credit tracking, and regulatory ticketing configurations (such as TABS and Petroex) to control purchasing authorization and billing operations.""" ;
