# Entity: Brand_Credit_Card_Dealer_Hierarchy_Dim
:mdm_core_Brand_Credit_Card_Dealer_Hierarchy_Dim a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Brand_Credit_Card_Dealer_Hierarchy_Dim" ;
    dcterms:identifier "14" ;
    dcterms:description """This table structures dealer organizations into a multi-level hierarchy, capturing details from corporation and chain to agent layers, supporting robust relationship mapping within the brand credit card ecosystem. Examples of chain levels include Rebeluct, Shelluct, SpeedwayUCT, and SupSeller, representing various organizational branches or affiliations. Each hierarchy level is defined with codes and names, alongside merchant and banking identifiers, offering precise context for every dealer’s placement within broader corporate structures.""" ;
    :externalTermLinkMissing true .

