:mdm_core_Brand_Credit_Card_Dealer_Class_Dim a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Brand_Credit_Card_Dealer_Class_Dim" ;
    dcterms:identifier "15" ;
    dcterms:description """This table organizes dealer entities into defined classifications such as Jobber, Dealer, Exchange, and Seller, supporting clear segmentation across credit card operations and brand management activities. Each classification offers a standardized label and descriptive details that drive business rules and operational workflows throughout the system. Disablement tracking is included to support life-cycle management and provide historical context for changes in dealer categories.""" ;
