# Entity: SAP_Customer_Company_Code_Dim
:mdm_core_SAP_Customer_Company_Code_Dim a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "SAP_Customer_Company_Code_Dim" ;
    dcterms:identifier "23" ;
    dcterms:description """This table stores company code specific financial profiles, reconciliation accounts, dunning configurations, and payment terms for customer business partners in SAP. It defines crucial localized accounting parameters such as payment methods, tolerance groups, lockbox keys, clearing house designations, and tax dunning configurations required to govern customer transactions at the individual legal entity level. Downstream, it provides the core financial configurations that enforce accounts receivable processing, automate interest calculations, and authorize general ledger postings for core partner functions (such as Sold-to and Payer) prior to final financial reconciliation and settlement.""" ;
    :externalTermLinkMissing true .

