# Entity: Flowcal_Customer_Dim
:mdm_core_Flowcal_Customer_Dim a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Flowcal_Customer_Dim" ;
    dcterms:identifier "27" ;
    dcterms:description """This table captures midstream customer identities and logistics role classifications sourced from the Flowcal volumetric measurement and audit system. It defines party designations across diverse transportation modes, specifically identifying shippers, transporters, railroads, and truck/rail consignors and consignees. Downstream, it establishes the master customer framework required to associate temperature-corrected, audited physical delivery volumes with commercial contracts for settlement and billing.""" ;
    :externalTermLinkMissing true .

